{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "1ef0dd62c9abf93323fcc61976779c308274b3ff8472df3b1dd6ed9862c65b1e", "ja": "えっと……ファンのみんな！\n桃子から目を離したら、ラリアットだからね。", "zh": "呃……各位粉丝们！\n敢把目光从桃子身上移开，就得吃桃子的金臂勾喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f052e0cce6da3fb727d75a918caab524194691f85585e85992561a94217f594b", "ja": "（なんだこれ）", "zh": "（她们在做什么啊？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "43fdb62d9cf2884e87e016b823b99fc01d96dd241f0acf56e614bcc22d96cc2a", "ja": "続いて、赤コーナー……『カラテの王子様』！\n97ポンド、菊地、真ォー！", "zh": "接下来，是红色角落的……『空手道王子』！\n97磅，菊──地──真──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "09a0566e05d9a26662ef62005b4640053a33463c546993648058a9a5f228b94e", "ja": "セイッ！　ハッ！　ヤーッ！\n安心して！　顔は狙わないから！", "zh": "嘿！喝！呀──！\n放心吧！在下不会打脸的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "b937228c6cd329172cf479e62009cdcbe76eadeee7eaa110713e39827d9d8ef8", "ja": "そして最後は……『戦慄の満漢全席』！\n99ポンド、佐竹、美ィー奈ァー子ォー！", "zh": "而最后是……『战栗的满汉全席』！\n99磅，佐竹──美──奈──子──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "7980393e3677ba5e3084bf84ff3d02fe80e1831b8bccbc256b3f7832af9d1bfe", "ja": "お腹が空いたら、佐竹飯店！\nお得なセットメニューもありますよ♪", "zh": "要是肚子饿了，就来佐竹饭店！\n有划算套餐可以吃喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "1a7b982e93e42daf4f9880464131f527938eb9ebfdb477efc0d63e373631058b", "ja": "765プロの頂点が、ついに決まろうとしています！\n世紀の一戦を、見逃すなっ！", "zh": "我们终于要决定出谁才是765艺能的顶点了！\n可别错过这场世纪之战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "68237c19ead3f79f08ffdaff55577efa854d99f2e71fa12a188a1e5fcbd06de8", "ja": "さあ、いよいよ試合開始のゴングが……。", "zh": "请看，比赛开始的铃声即将响起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1014_p", "source_sha256": "488bdb779f1c7e254817a0f92af05690027990f274a99df6a458f6a24a4638f9", "ja": "おーい、ちょっと待ってくれ！\nこれは何をしてるんだ？", "zh": "喂──先等一下！\n你们这是在做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "f0e888d82e4fd961f52bd732f6aa814a7b01bb29a929b7600e0cc30e0d6b7b49", "ja": "お～～～～～っと！\nここで、{$P$}の乱入だーっ！！", "zh": "哎呀～！\n此时{$P$}突然闯入了──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "2f6ccc71b9990c11da2d3a30666e99b772be6b9639f56f9edfcce4eadc4bb588", "ja": "あ、お疲れさまです！　のり子さんに教えてもらって、\nプロレス風のMCの練習をしてたんですよ。", "zh": "工、工作辛苦了！法子在教我们类似职业摔角的\n主持方式，大家正在练习啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "f3194d67975f52eb096857cf5c76199c33b95d548f0a0d4bb70022020ca9e799", "ja": "ほら、今回ってリングがステージなんでしょ？\nそれならリングアナ風にMCができないかなーって。", "zh": "因为这次的舞台不是在擂台上吗？\n我就想说可以试试用摔角风格来主持～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e9ed0a19d8ed33607a4726ad2af589df3a4fdf4ac00dc1890409a61212f9a5f5", "ja": "そういう事か……確かに、面白いかもしれないけど。\nレッスンはどうしたんだ？", "zh": "是这样啊……听着确实是挺有趣的。\n但你们其他的练习呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "e7eb9b6527b841e37baa8854c9a3641d4cd0db2140d8938355e895de3b077631", "ja": "ふふん♪　もう終わったよ。\nお兄ちゃん、ちょっと来るのが遅いんじゃない？", "zh": "哼哼♪练习已经结束了喔。\n大哥哥，你来得是不是有点晚啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6786caf7cb67527bc99de23c81820d4b49018b72c2c00d1e02e83ac5bde267ab", "ja": "えっ、もう……！？", "zh": "咦，已经结束了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "2afab579175686f7bc631f0604582d151c3b1613f333fef4bf554b165244991d", "ja": "はいっ、{$P$}！\n安心してください、ダンスもしっかりやってますから。", "zh": "是啊，{$P$}！\n你放心吧，我们也有认真练习跳舞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "c21e05503ca97928d6d91b4edf11d29f8396c3215efcb1643ef8736ce6b03a38", "ja": "真ちゃんが見てくれてるんですよ。\nちょうど、一段落したところだったんです。", "zh": "小真有在盯我们练习喔。\n我们刚好告一段落了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3830bc17c0009da21479ca9312a61f0cbb927c80a08c5fedbe98c49fadce6578", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\n休憩中にもMCの練習なんて、気合い入ってるな！", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n你们居然连休息时间也在练习主持，很认真嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "7489e7b2ae3630162679bd9cef303dca0c5e7bca34749ed4615b0a2edce94bad", "ja": "はい！　プロレスのリングで公演なんて、\n面白いじゃないですか。くぅ～っ、燃えるなぁ！", "zh": "是啊！没想到可以在职业摔角的擂台上公演，\n真是太有趣了。呜～好让人热血沸腾喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "e6c6b173fec72496ea44074f5ca98ec68d9e49870675547c275ed9ec28c93585", "ja": "アタシ、とにかく熱いステージにしたいんだよね！", "zh": "我很想打造出超级热血的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "0059ed59735f8aa4f51e50e5626d32bdf5475e9fd5220d9612172f24a39afa0a", "ja": "観客のみんなにも、選手の人たちにも、\n元気になってもらえるようなさ！", "zh": "就是那种让所有观众和选手\n看了都会很有活力的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "8bccea56e3dc7ed80c970fc31be3adf17960464c6a55a4edca79b0364a33d993", "ja": "でも、ホントにこれでいいのかな……？\n桃子たち、アイドルなのに。", "zh": "不过，真的该这么主持吗……？\n桃子我们明明是偶像的说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3ff515bdab6761cd01dcff138d1be07532962026fa79b32feaa8643470079ab9", "ja": "いいんじゃないか？　みんなも楽しそうだったし、\nきっとお客さんも楽しんでくれるよ。", "zh": "应该没问题吧？我看你们练得很开心，\n那观众到时一定也会看得很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "23b4b58def0408cf40d1c143b37bb70dc7df8b7fe9b299111f392e66fac6434e", "ja": "ふふっ！　そうですよね。\n実は私も、けっこう楽しくて♪", "zh": "呵呵！就是说啊，\n其实我也满开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "990e5207817d27df6c7d4327017e6b5dbec76e156801c43e32896a403a2d7c59", "ja": "まあ……桃子も、ちょっと楽しかったかも。\nでも、ちょっとだけだからね！", "zh": "嗯……桃子也是有点开心啦。\n但是只有一点点而已喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "2766300d69ab492d589fac16a1d846ce04104388c7f223f6e05ebd5236dcf14b", "ja": "よーしっ！　この勢いで、本番のリングまで\n全力で駆け抜けるから。みんな、よろしくねっ！", "zh": "很好～！我们要保持这个气势，\n全力冲刺到正式上擂台时。大家，请多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "3b49c19fda52a58148630fd7069f6d4704b28cc82b59d0c1acdc7b7230c5d032", "ja": "まかせて！　のり子の背中はボクたちが預かるから、\n最高に熱いステージにしよう！", "zh": "包在我们身上！法子的背后就交给我们了，\n大家一起打造出热血到不行的表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1033_019min", "source_sha256": "3cb802e3a483988883b201e829da64f929d08408c1fd579e862f9d92b02e6166", "ja": "うんうん！　のり子ちゃんが全力を出せるように、\n私たちもサポートするからね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！我们会好好支援小法，\n让你可以发挥出全力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
