{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1042_043nor", "source_sha256": "8b41ce76cb428c6a1245a805dd2edb782b205918ee6a9513361b684f4b9cdd38", "ja": "えへへ、ちょっとね。\n{$P$}のこと、待ってたんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我有点事情要做啦。\n我在等{$P$}啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1043_p", "source_sha256": "bb7c5270e45285008a7a08b487494c7cefaca990fdbd5cd887a679ab12b830f8", "ja": "待ってたって、こんな時間まで？", "zh": "你等我等到这么晚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1044_043nor", "source_sha256": "3d4dfb1a5e311c9823038dc181639ee614af9954a9d4e0530fd2e03c40da624c", "ja": "うん。あのさ、えーっと……あ、お腹減ってない！？\n何か食べて帰ろうよ！　アタシ、焼肉がいいなっ。", "zh": "嗯，就是，呃……啊，你肚子饿不饿！？\n我们去吃点东西再回去吧！我想吃烧肉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1045_043nor", "source_sha256": "09948cbf872454a5f3ebc57e38a497e04d85634fe3c6a228504d401f81992884", "ja": "レッスン頑張ったから、今日はガッツリ\nお肉とか食べたーい！ってカンジなんだよね！", "zh": "我今天练习得很努力，\n现在很想吃一大堆肉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "d3b06662cf3a221dbdb6138e967eda763dc889ce043a3ab43b401bb2d5193d71", "ja": "あっ……でも、もう遅いか。\nじ、じゃあ、軽く食べられるものでも……！", "zh": "啊……但都已经这么晚了。\n那、那还是改去吃点轻便的食物也好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_1047", "source_sha256": "2cf4a3ea683ac6d6424ef2833c72e2038cbb5a78c91dba1f63db4b0300362af0", "ja": "大丈夫？", "zh": "你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4383587ad17285f47fe349cc75ec74d373d804d22f7c3c9a8e3667a92c5d9319", "ja": "のり子、大丈夫か？\n……何か悩みがあるなら、話してみてくれ。", "zh": "法子，你还好吗？\n……要是有什么烦恼，就跟我说说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2001_043nor", "source_sha256": "9e1dca56d82fed0c375e2cf327128f1c4e7e4add31375274d2637f74203efb99", "ja": "え……えっと……あは、あはは！\nアタシって、わかりやすいのかな？　はは……。", "zh": "呃……那个……哈、哈哈！\n我有这么好懂吗？哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2002_043nor", "source_sha256": "0d7aabb9451df2381209a9c3123eac6f621ea01aeb095bfeea8f3c967daee9e4", "ja": "あ、あのさ……\nあのね、{$P$}。", "zh": "那、那个……\n我说啊，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2003_043nor", "source_sha256": "1cc9ee860f1620c160dca32092295f4a1a43d2470ad8bffd4a54ae1dee38f340", "ja": "センター……ホントに、アタシでよかったの？\n別の子のほうが、よかったんじゃないかな？", "zh": "Center……选我真的好吗？\n是不是换成其他人来担任会比较好啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2004_043nor", "source_sha256": "3642f10100a458a5ac567dedc3c53530f45ca601b12385a56129c79044bf1955", "ja": "もっと有名な、アイドル～って感じの！\nたとえば春香とか！　やっぱ、カワイイしさ！", "zh": "可以选一些更有名、感觉更像偶像的人啊！\n比方说像春香之类的！她很可爱嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2005_p", "source_sha256": "5f26f6ff99b07a5bce9ea060ad128e41668a6cec70fd1329f938128b75430db6", "ja": "のり子……？\nどうして急に、そんな事を言うんだ？", "zh": "法子……？\n你为什么要突然这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2006_043nor", "source_sha256": "fc61f7f6518c0f64ef3faa884b03a39293812f120d5d3e167f8ce0ad9cbe99a8", "ja": "だって、だってさ……。\n……あ、あれ？", "zh": "因为，因为……\n……奇、奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2007_043nor", "source_sha256": "4ee74c7bc16ec6ec48226750d2fc6509d6e1ce78098803844f0a653690238c0d", "ja": "あ、あはは。な、なんか、涙出てきちゃった！\nごめん、ちょっとタイム！　なんでもないからっ！", "zh": "哈、哈哈，眼、眼泪莫名就飙出来了！\n抱歉，等我一下！我没事的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2008_p", "source_sha256": "ab2457bd8fdaecd0090ad6b1a51ed58e11e96cabada85221c44380753d234520", "ja": "不安があるなら、全部話してくれないか。\n上手く言えなくてもいいんだ。ちゃんと聞くから。", "zh": "如果你会感到不安，可以跟我说说原因吗？\n就算不太能具体描述也没关系，我会好好听完的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2009_043nor", "source_sha256": "1168e7ee8abfac126b0ae18259564bbd5044ae16e5024830752f5ebf24f1f162", "ja": "{$P$}……うん。ぐすっ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯，呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2010_043nor", "source_sha256": "3e7a6c6c778648aef255c5aa413bf3607247dbcfcc9d17fcebcc2efafb5906fe", "ja": "はぁ……やっぱりアタシ、自信ないよ～……。\nアタシなんて、まだアイドルとしてヒヨッコだし。", "zh": "唉……我果然还是没有自信啦……\n毕竟我根本就还只是个菜鸟偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2011_043nor", "source_sha256": "cb4bb5e668f5ab733cf3e5b19e8e2ac88d690095cfc6015ec7d1960f746ef72f", "ja": "パフォーマンスのレベルも、全然だしさ。\nお客さんは、プロレスファンの人たちでしょ？", "zh": "而且我表演的水准也完全不够高。\n那些观众，都是职业摔角迷对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2012_043nor", "source_sha256": "9f33fb2ae1918c8b0df8c78326490cc805e0d9119a35c9ef6ea65daf7ce730fb", "ja": "そんな中で、会場を盛り上げるなんてできないかも……\nそしたら迷惑かけるかも、って考えちゃって……。", "zh": "我就会想说，这样我可能炒热不了会场的气氛……\n结果给大家添麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2013_p", "source_sha256": "ba9379ff0d61acce5d550c1924aced358e543a6db26fee0d41ce18d424bfe46d", "ja": "そうか……のり子の気持ちはわかったよ。\nけどやっぱり、今回のセンターはのり子しかいない。", "zh": "这样啊……我明白法子你的心情了。\n不过，这次的Center果然还是非你莫属。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2014_043nor", "source_sha256": "f3101f8652a47ca91451359e637ccea0bb9f517b3fc0d01fdf499e1fb84f1f40", "ja": "ええっ！？　ど、どうして……？", "zh": "咦咦！？为、为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2015_p", "source_sha256": "53bcb0a9f625e45aa93fd1cf73fc8af2d1397f88e72817e086079c6710f7c28c", "ja": "プロレス団体の、新人興行だって言っただろ？\n同じ立場ののり子が、ピッタリだと思うんだ。", "zh": "我之前不是说，这次是职业摔角团体的新人演出吗？\n我觉得处境相同的法子正好适合担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2016_p", "source_sha256": "701602ce7304a9527eb258de967c16a11cba56d25aaab22fa0fd2e83bded5e4c", "ja": "そうだな……新人興行に出場する選手たちと\nのり子、どこが同じだと思う？", "zh": "我想想……法子，\n你觉得在新人演出里出场的选手，和你有什么共通点呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2017_043nor", "source_sha256": "891810e44c5fd40cc51acd5e634808d0cfc8055c63387510ff3985139b391700", "ja": "え？　えっと……。\nデビューしたばかり、ってこと……？", "zh": "咦？呃……\n你是想说我们都刚出道吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2018_p", "source_sha256": "b4cb8b1a823ed0801fce9b18ac3a0e8b76527a20ef5507b3eee0499cd42b051c", "ja": "そうだな。どっちも、これからどんな風に育っていくか\n未知数……同じほうが、いいと思ったんだ。", "zh": "是啊，两边的未来发展都充满无法预期的未知……\n我觉得选处境相似的人比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2019_p", "source_sha256": "e098ca1e6332aa30c80bd3373cfab9f31e951afc0af8e8d0e6c3d8d8a671d781", "ja": "アイドルにも試合にも、フレッシュな可能性が\n感じられる公演にできたら、最高だと思わないか？", "zh": "不管是偶像还是比赛，若能在表演时让人感受到\n耳目一新的可能性，你不觉得很棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2020_043nor", "source_sha256": "b30b4b587e9dbd47092981823efd1a142539594b1c745f9cdb3c26ed440666b5", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。単純に、プロレスだから\nアタシなのかと思ってたよ……あはっ！", "zh": "原来是这样啊……我还以为单纯只是\n我和职业摔角有关才找我……啊哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2021_p", "source_sha256": "8172611e2f92b5b99c5c1673fda5f9680dc35e6e2fc2ab89c18c3a90d0a5b135", "ja": "もちろん、それも大きいよ。\nのり子は格闘技が好きだったよな？", "zh": "这当然也是一个很大的理由啊。\n法子你很喜欢格斗技对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2022_043nor", "source_sha256": "5bad5a5848c18291eae89af6f1046089f0820d3b3f1c67b30bcc1fd9a428896f", "ja": "そりゃあ、大好きだよっ！\n見てると熱くなるし、パワーを感じるっていうか……。", "zh": "当然是喜欢到不行啊！\n我光是看着就会热血起来，该说是能感受到力量吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2023_043nor", "source_sha256": "7f0153c139b09fde95d07ae972156c1f2d45f7a7b1006e420372f2107830353f", "ja": "勝ち負けもそりゃ、大事だけど。選手たちが\n力を振り絞って戦う姿が、何よりカッコイイんだよね！", "zh": "决出胜负是挺重要的，\n但选手们用尽全力奋斗的身姿，才是最帅的部分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2024_p", "source_sha256": "70ada3344b5f03e0920640c3db8b18cbb30a718ab2c1882773f83f5b2ab60c7b", "ja": "そうか。……一番大事な事、\nのり子は、ちゃんとわかってるんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n法子你很清楚什么是最重要的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2025_p", "source_sha256": "ba2965b125d30433d2f1c0f3c8a8bbf473e35bb6b877c107493687171a2f7621", "ja": "のり子が感じているその気持ちを、全力でぶつけてきて\nほしい。熱い思いは、不器用でも通じるはずだ。", "zh": "我希望你能把你所感受到的那些想法，全力表现出来。\n就算你不善表达，大家一定也能意会到这炽热的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2027_043nor", "source_sha256": "23ad2b2a2ff6c068d3bcab17966ac4b3f347f7d843df7d384da06605afbe20c4", "ja": "わ、わかった……やってみるよ！　そうだよね、\nアタシ、まだ新人だし。全力でぶつかるしかないよね？", "zh": "我、我知道了……我会试试看！你说的对，\n毕竟我还是新人，除了全力以赴之外也别无他法了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2028_043nor", "source_sha256": "f03a617f5746ec92dff2b4c946c88e73525a1e686e9260a973bdffed37299c5b", "ja": "失敗を怖がってたら、勝てる試合にも勝てないし。\n元気が、アタシの取り柄だっ！　やってやる～！", "zh": "光只是害怕失败，本来能赢的比赛也赢不了了。\n我最大的优点就是充满活力！看我大显身手吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2029_043nor", "source_sha256": "bb4b00131f59e8bd198d19f2efc0421fa80674c23d9b3cf4fdba38104c336dd7", "ja": "えへへっ。ありがとね、{$P$}！\nすっごい元気出た！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢啦，{$P$}！\n我现在很有精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2030_p", "source_sha256": "73bcbea87f1ebc90e267183f7e1292374831d87fff30896d1b2b019658dd6764", "ja": "（こぼれた涙の跡が嘘のような、晴れやかな笑顔。\nこれなら、心配なさそうだ……頑張れ、のり子！）", "zh": "（她露出了爽朗的笑容，就像方才的泪痕不曾存在过。\n看来应该不用担心了……加油，法子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2031_null", "source_sha256": "877a3477f054ac22dd272cf3a46aa811b717c5f7a38d7b114b24241e21554638", "ja": "プロレス興行、当日……", "zh": "到了职业摔角表演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2032_043nor", "source_sha256": "c4656ec568f83ce9d9c2c2005f619b38ec61219ee4b39056ed09e075a7a93eaf", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nねえねえ、見た？　チケット売り場とか、売店とか！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n欸欸，你有看到吗？售票口和贩卖部那边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2033_p", "source_sha256": "a52fffd250eac21d8a8804db506ee1958e0ef01bde76e6e42ec8c6e806d3255d", "ja": "見たけど……それがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "我有去看啊……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2034_043nor", "source_sha256": "b9dc729b66eefdc7d32c3213f7f2e1144d931d4514d23bfd6f1cc400a8385032", "ja": "スタッフの人、新人選手なんだよ！　ホントに\nアタシたちと……劇場のアイドルと、同じなんだね。", "zh": "那些工作人员都是新人选手喔！\n他们真的和我们……和剧场的偶像们一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2035_043nor", "source_sha256": "ae6b784426e1eb8c1a27cae9eb7bac7e268b915b43f48b0bdb54e2dd1cd0e4f5", "ja": "みんな、すごく初々しくてさ……。\n絶対、元気を届けなきゃ！って気になったよっ！", "zh": "大家都显得好青涩……\n我看到他们，就觉得我一定要传递活力给他们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2036_p", "source_sha256": "be662c46a5b8a7c6128c7836eea95c12c4a9c0ff69443e23965e8a8d0a780203", "ja": "よし、その意気だ！\nリングサイドで見てるから、いい試合にしような！", "zh": "很好，这么积极就对了！\n我会在擂台边看着你的，要打造一场好比赛喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_037_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_037_2037_043nor", "source_sha256": "416f131e261ce09f575e4974ae9ad8746a11acc96999873b197bc435cd581906", "ja": "うん！　アタシ、精いっぱいぶつかってくるから……。\nセコンドよろしくねっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯！我会使出全力去表演的……\n就拜托你当场边助手啰，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
